WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.070
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:23.340 --> 00:24.910
This spring is full of spiritual power.

3
00:25.560 --> 00:26.900
It's a great aid to cultivation.

4
00:27.650 --> 00:28.810
Could this be the source?

5
00:30.080 --> 00:31.620
How did they find this place?

6
00:32.960 --> 00:33.610
You're awake?

7
00:36.310 --> 00:37.090
Qi Fengyin?

8
00:38.160 --> 00:38.730
Where are my clothes?

9
00:38.920 --> 00:39.940
You're weak.

10
00:40.560 --> 00:42.010
You have to soak here

11
00:42.710 --> 00:43.900
to gain spiritual power.

12
00:44.920 --> 00:46.580
So you stripped me?

13
00:47.840 --> 00:49.050
You haven't seen a pretty woman

14
00:49.070 --> 00:50.140
in 1,000 years on Mount Qihuang.

15
00:50.140 --> 00:51.330
I should've been on my guard.

16
00:51.520 --> 00:52.140
Taking advantage of me

17
00:52.160 --> 00:52.970
while I was unconscious?

18
00:53.480 --> 00:54.540
- How dare you...! - Shut up.

19
00:56.630 --> 00:57.780
I have no interest in looking after you.

20
00:58.840 --> 01:00.290
Youyou brought you here.

21
01:01.110 --> 01:02.580
That black dragon lives here.

22
01:02.880 --> 01:04.170
The foul energy here is so strong

23
01:04.640 --> 01:06.060
that no one else can get near.

24
01:06.390 --> 01:07.290
I'm the only one

25
01:07.880 --> 01:09.500
who can stay and watch over you.

26
01:16.850 --> 01:18.290
Turn around and cover your eyes.

27
01:18.440 --> 01:19.140
Don't turn back.

28
01:47.540 --> 01:53.420
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

29
01:55.460 --> 02:01.420
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

30
02:02.460 --> 02:06.700
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

31
02:10.380 --> 02:17.940
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

32
02:18.300 --> 02:25.060
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

33
02:26.300 --> 02:32.940
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

34
02:34.140 --> 02:40.980
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

35
02:42.580 --> 02:49.100
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

36
02:53.860 --> 02:55.660
[Blossom in Darkness]

37
02:55.660 --> 02:57.660
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

38
02:57.660 --> 03:00.660
[Episode 9]

39
03:04.320 --> 03:05.010
I've thought it over.

40
03:05.430 --> 03:06.410
I need to teach you a few

41
03:06.410 --> 03:07.160
basic rules of conduct.

42
03:07.360 --> 03:08.250
What rules?

43
03:12.710 --> 03:14.060
You may be fairly handsome,

44
03:14.710 --> 03:16.220
but you know nothing of human decency.

45
03:16.430 --> 03:17.180
Without any manners,

46
03:17.360 --> 03:18.030
you're just

47
03:18.030 --> 03:19.130
a beast in human skin.

48
03:19.390 --> 03:21.020
When I was soaking in the spring,

49
03:21.270 --> 03:22.560
any decent person would've known

50
03:22.560 --> 03:23.220
to look away.

51
03:23.360 --> 03:24.180
We're of opposite sexes.

52
03:24.240 --> 03:25.280
You should've given me some privacy.

53
03:25.280 --> 03:25.740
Understand?

54
03:28.150 --> 03:28.730
Do you understand?

55
03:31.960 --> 03:32.590
But I don't see

56
03:32.590 --> 03:33.980
the difference.

57
03:35.470 --> 03:36.470
Take a good look!

58
03:36.470 --> 03:37.340
Of course there's a difference!

59
03:57.030 --> 03:58.610
If what Yuanbao said is true

60
03:59.560 --> 04:01.220
and that black dragon lives here,

61
04:02.590 --> 04:03.780
wouldn't you be as good as dead

62
04:04.310 --> 04:05.500
if you were unconscious again?

63
04:06.190 --> 04:07.060
Even then,

64
04:07.080 --> 04:08.170
should I still look away?

65
04:13.280 --> 04:14.340
Well, obviously, my life

66
04:14.360 --> 04:14.940
comes first.

67
04:17.630 --> 04:18.700
It depends on the situation.

68
04:19.240 --> 04:20.460
You could've at least covered your eyes.

69
04:28.630 --> 04:29.460
You call me

70
04:29.870 --> 04:31.290
a beast in human skin.

71
04:32.120 --> 04:33.540
Is your dear Hao

72
04:34.190 --> 04:35.660
a good man who follows the rules?

73
04:38.000 --> 04:39.100
Why bring him up all of a sudden?

74
04:39.950 --> 04:42.140
Hao is honorable

75
04:42.270 --> 04:43.100
and a true gentleman.

76
04:44.510 --> 04:45.460
He's nothing like you.

77
04:49.190 --> 04:50.660
If everything he does is right,

78
04:51.510 --> 04:52.900
was he right to try to kill you

79
04:53.600 --> 04:54.290
and take

80
04:55.560 --> 04:56.220
your herb core?

81
04:58.240 --> 04:58.920
Then should I

82
04:58.920 --> 05:00.500
follow the rules like him,

83
05:00.890 --> 05:02.410
kill you right now,

84
05:02.800 --> 05:04.540
and send you back to the immortal sects?

85
05:18.120 --> 05:19.780
Whether I'm a human

86
05:20.920 --> 05:22.190
or a beast,

87
05:23.000 --> 05:23.780
as I've said,

88
05:24.360 --> 05:25.990
I don't care what you or anyone else

89
05:26.870 --> 05:27.580
thinks of me.

90
05:29.510 --> 05:31.290
That flower is all I care about.

91
05:32.600 --> 05:33.700
Killing her myself

92
05:34.600 --> 05:36.250
is all I live for.

93
05:41.390 --> 05:42.340
This spring water

94
05:42.950 --> 05:43.780
is remarkable indeed.

95
05:45.070 --> 05:46.020
But it seems

96
05:46.630 --> 05:47.900
it can only offer temporary relief.

97
05:48.310 --> 05:49.370
It can't cure my condition.

98
05:50.070 --> 05:51.290
Once I leave this spring,

99
05:52.310 --> 05:53.490
the malice will hurt me again.

100
06:02.480 --> 06:03.700
Are you making an artifact?

101
06:04.600 --> 06:05.980
I've examined the soil

102
06:07.040 --> 06:07.730
around this spring.

103
06:08.870 --> 06:10.250
Using it as a conduit

104
06:11.240 --> 06:12.220
will keep this artifact

105
06:12.240 --> 06:13.700
connected to the spring.

106
06:14.360 --> 06:15.250
Could it be

107
06:15.600 --> 06:16.540
that the lake on Mount Qihuang

108
06:16.560 --> 06:17.540
was created the same way?

109
06:18.190 --> 06:18.780
Is that why

110
06:19.270 --> 06:20.410
they share the same source?

111
06:20.510 --> 06:20.930
I don't know.

112
06:22.190 --> 06:22.980
This artifact

113
06:23.310 --> 06:24.540
will take half a day to finish.

114
06:36.160 --> 06:37.020
Teach me to read in the meantime.

115
06:41.000 --> 06:42.420
You have no interest in anything

116
06:42.420 --> 06:43.810
but the mystical flower.

117
06:43.870 --> 06:45.420
Why bother learning to read?

118
06:46.580 --> 06:47.460
Just teach me to read,

119
06:48.190 --> 06:48.810
not how to behave.

120
06:52.870 --> 06:53.340
All right.

121
06:53.940 --> 06:54.850
Then how about

122
06:55.000 --> 06:56.410
calling me Master first?

123
06:56.750 --> 06:58.490
I'll start your lessons right away.

124
06:58.600 --> 06:59.290
All right.

125
07:00.000 --> 07:00.800
Then I suppose I can

126
07:00.800 --> 07:01.540
stop making this artifact.

127
07:01.870 --> 07:03.170
I'll just plant you here.

128
07:03.390 --> 07:04.490
Whenever I find a wisp of malice,

129
07:04.680 --> 07:05.710
I'll come back and water you.

130
07:05.710 --> 07:06.900
Watch closely!

131
07:18.950 --> 07:19.780
This

132
07:20.390 --> 07:21.490
is your name,

133
07:22.240 --> 07:23.370
Qi Fengyin.

134
07:24.720 --> 07:25.660
And this

135
07:26.270 --> 07:27.580
is my name.

136
07:27.780 --> 07:30.580
[Yamao, Qi Fengyin]

137
07:31.160 --> 07:32.050
Both our names have birds

138
07:32.070 --> 07:32.930
in them. [*Ya: a duck; Feng: a phoenix]

139
07:33.830 --> 07:34.850
Why does yours

140
07:34.870 --> 07:35.780
sound so much classier?

141
08:02.740 --> 08:05.620
[Yamao, Qi Fengyin, Yamao]

142
08:05.750 --> 08:06.930
Why are you called Yamao?

143
08:43.630 --> 08:44.180
Master,

144
08:44.200 --> 08:45.340
I know what my name should be.

145
08:45.360 --> 08:46.100
Yamao. [*duck feather]

146
08:46.670 --> 08:47.650
You've just taken human form.

147
08:47.670 --> 08:48.420
You don't know much yet.

148
08:48.750 --> 08:50.340
You can choose a name later.

149
08:51.720 --> 08:53.300
I want to be called Yamao.

150
08:55.670 --> 08:56.700
But that name

151
08:57.000 --> 08:58.340
isn't very elegant.

152
09:04.790 --> 09:05.340
All right.

153
09:05.910 --> 09:07.010
If you like it,

154
09:07.150 --> 09:08.130
Yamao it is.

155
09:19.390 --> 09:20.460
What am I doing?

156
09:21.240 --> 09:22.170
Master's soul crystal

157
09:22.170 --> 09:23.340
is still in Qi Fengyin's hands.

158
09:24.240 --> 09:25.200
Yet I just went

159
09:25.200 --> 09:25.940
against Master's teachings

160
09:26.510 --> 09:27.980
and tried to open up to him.

161
09:35.390 --> 09:36.060
If we

162
09:36.720 --> 09:38.130
want to use this spring's power,

163
09:39.120 --> 09:39.980
shouldn't we

164
09:40.200 --> 09:41.460
tell the demons living here first?

165
09:42.150 --> 09:43.370
I've made a deal with them.

166
09:44.600 --> 09:45.650
But before we go,

167
09:46.750 --> 09:47.700
please promise, sir,

168
09:48.150 --> 09:49.370
that you'll save our lives.

169
09:51.270 --> 09:51.850
The Saintess

170
09:52.670 --> 09:54.100
created the Mystical Core with her divine power

171
09:54.360 --> 09:55.340
to sustain Peach Blossom Paradise.

172
09:55.870 --> 09:56.980
But that vile black dragon

173
09:57.000 --> 09:58.370
has been slaughtering us demons

174
09:58.750 --> 10:00.420
to use our souls in a blood sacrifice

175
10:00.840 --> 10:02.250
and force the Mystical Core to appear.

176
10:03.390 --> 10:04.530
Our suffering is beyond words.

177
10:05.480 --> 10:06.490
You're so powerful, sir.

178
10:07.080 --> 10:08.010
Please save us

179
10:08.240 --> 10:09.340
and slay the black dragon!

180
10:11.870 --> 10:13.130
No wonder this paradise

181
10:13.150 --> 10:14.130
has become such a foul place.

182
10:16.150 --> 10:17.010
So you agreed to help?

183
10:17.390 --> 10:17.850
Of course.

184
10:21.030 --> 10:22.580
I caught a glimpse of the black dragon.

185
10:23.960 --> 10:25.460
I'd never felt such overwhelming power before.

186
10:26.440 --> 10:27.580
This is serious.

187
10:27.910 --> 10:29.010
Why didn't you tell me sooner?

188
10:29.440 --> 10:30.180
Tell you sooner?

189
10:31.320 --> 10:33.010
I'll be fighting a mighty ancient demon.

190
10:33.480 --> 10:34.650
What good would telling you do?

191
10:35.630 --> 10:36.980
Of course it would help.

192
10:37.960 --> 10:39.060
I could stop you.

193
10:40.320 --> 10:41.770
That's a vicious ancient demon

194
10:42.080 --> 10:43.770
that's absorbed all of the paradise's spiritual power.

195
10:44.320 --> 10:45.420
With your current strength,

196
10:45.670 --> 10:47.010
the fight could go either way.

197
10:47.360 --> 10:48.370
We need to learn

198
10:48.390 --> 10:49.420
the dragon's habits first.

199
10:49.790 --> 10:51.700
We need to know what we're up against to win.

200
10:52.200 --> 10:52.730
Besides,

201
10:53.750 --> 10:54.610
who says I'm useless?

202
10:55.000 --> 10:55.580
We can

203
10:55.910 --> 10:57.580
pick a windy, moonlit night

204
10:57.790 --> 10:58.370
to ambush it.

205
10:58.630 --> 10:59.820
Even if you can't beat it,

206
11:00.200 --> 11:01.180
I can get us out of there.

207
11:01.200 --> 11:01.820
Forget it.

208
11:02.390 --> 11:03.370
If anything happened to me,

209
11:04.080 --> 11:05.340
you'd be the first to try

210
11:05.360 --> 11:06.180
to finish me off.

211
11:07.870 --> 11:08.980
If it came to that,

212
11:09.390 --> 11:10.300
I'd crush

213
11:10.390 --> 11:11.490
your master's soul crystal first.

214
11:19.510 --> 11:20.700
Once Yamao's problem is solved,

215
11:21.120 --> 11:22.370
I'll take her and His Lordship

216
11:22.390 --> 11:23.250
and get out of here.

217
11:23.630 --> 11:24.890
Who cares about that black dragon?

218
11:25.120 --> 11:26.770
That demon's devoured all the spiritual power here.

219
11:27.120 --> 11:28.370
No one sane would risk their life fighting it.

220
11:32.910 --> 11:33.370
Careful!

221
11:36.840 --> 11:38.100
That spring water was hard to come by.

222
11:38.120 --> 11:38.890
Don't spill it.

223
11:39.000 --> 11:40.180
Then why don't you help me carry it?

224
11:40.600 --> 11:41.700
I thought you were kind

225
11:41.720 --> 11:42.890
and was starting to like you.

226
11:43.270 --> 11:44.420
But you used the spring water

227
11:44.550 --> 11:45.580
Yamao needed to survive

228
11:45.600 --> 11:46.460
to force His Lordship to help you.

229
11:47.480 --> 11:48.460
And now I'm stuck

230
11:48.480 --> 11:49.420
doing your heavy lifting too.

231
11:51.030 --> 11:52.650
I know I'm taking advantage of you.

232
11:53.360 --> 11:54.580
But the foul energy here is so strong.

233
11:55.080 --> 11:55.940
If the black dragon isn't killed,

234
11:56.150 --> 11:57.770
every living thing on this island will die.

235
11:58.600 --> 11:59.060
Youyou,

236
11:59.700 --> 12:00.770
yell at me all you want.

237
12:05.960 --> 12:06.650
Oh, I will.

238
12:08.670 --> 12:09.010
We're here.

239
12:18.550 --> 12:19.220
I'm back!

240
12:19.480 --> 12:20.250
Come get some water!

241
12:20.910 --> 12:21.730
Yuanbao's back!

242
12:22.120 --> 12:22.940
We have water!

243
12:30.910 --> 12:31.370
Be careful.

244
12:31.670 --> 12:32.180
Thank you.

245
12:32.940 --> 12:33.820
- Thank you. - Here.

246
12:34.720 --> 12:35.030
Thank you.

247
12:35.030 --> 12:35.820
Here, take two.

248
12:36.000 --> 12:36.490
Thank you.

249
12:39.750 --> 12:40.730
For generations, we demons here

250
12:40.750 --> 12:41.980
have fed on spiritual power.

251
12:43.390 --> 12:44.180
Now

252
12:45.120 --> 12:46.060
we're all dying.

253
12:47.440 --> 12:48.340
We have no choice but to drink

254
12:48.360 --> 12:49.300
the spring water to survive.

255
12:50.030 --> 12:51.530
I risk my life every time I fetch it.

256
12:52.150 --> 12:52.610
Youyou,

257
12:53.080 --> 12:53.850
thank you for helping me.

258
13:00.120 --> 13:00.890
Thank you.

259
13:01.120 --> 13:01.770
You're welcome.

260
13:06.080 --> 13:07.730
If you can't survive here,

261
13:08.790 --> 13:10.130
why don't you leave?

262
13:10.750 --> 13:11.850
Couldn't you live just fine

263
13:11.870 --> 13:12.940
in the outside world?

264
13:13.390 --> 13:14.340
It's not that simple.

265
13:15.670 --> 13:16.420
The black dragon

266
13:16.480 --> 13:17.890
wants to use us in a blood sacrifice

267
13:18.030 --> 13:19.370
to force the Mystical Core to appear.

268
13:20.510 --> 13:21.940
It's already imprisoned many of our souls.

269
13:23.120 --> 13:24.250
When the blood sacrifice takes place,

270
13:24.670 --> 13:26.220
those souls will be destroyed forever.

271
13:28.020 --> 13:29.420
I'm the only one with enough strength left

272
13:29.550 --> 13:30.580
to escape.

273
13:30.750 --> 13:32.250
How could I abandon everyone

274
13:32.320 --> 13:33.610
just to save myself?

275
13:46.080 --> 13:47.250
Oh, no! It's the black dragon!

276
13:48.440 --> 13:49.320
You should be hiding!

277
13:49.320 --> 13:50.100
Where are you going?

278
13:50.180 --> 13:51.010
I have to lure it away.

279
13:51.010 --> 13:51.980
I can't let it find this place!

280
13:52.000 --> 13:52.370
You...

281
13:52.910 --> 13:54.180
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

282
14:06.670 --> 14:07.250
Yuanbao!

283
14:25.630 --> 14:26.220
You vile demon!

284
14:27.000 --> 14:27.820
With all your power,

285
14:27.840 --> 14:28.890
you choose to attack your own kind?

286
14:29.600 --> 14:30.580
Have you no shame?

287
14:43.320 --> 14:44.010
Yamao,

288
14:44.150 --> 14:45.130
are you feeling better?

289
14:45.270 --> 14:46.070
Let's worry

290
14:46.070 --> 14:46.890
about staying alive first!

291
15:00.670 --> 15:01.460
Why provoke it

292
15:02.240 --> 15:03.530
instead of hiding?

293
15:07.390 --> 15:07.850
My Lord,

294
15:08.030 --> 15:09.700
the paradise's demons are all hiding in the woods.

295
15:09.840 --> 15:11.030
If the dragon goes any farther,

296
15:11.030 --> 15:12.820
they'll all die!

297
15:26.600 --> 15:27.490
Looks like we can't wait

298
15:27.510 --> 15:28.340
for your foolproof plan.

299
16:07.320 --> 16:07.770
Youyou,

300
16:07.840 --> 16:08.820
you're a mighty ancient demon.

301
16:09.120 --> 16:09.770
Don't you know how

302
16:09.790 --> 16:10.820
to deal with that black dragon?

303
16:11.390 --> 16:12.850
I can think of something. I can!

304
16:13.120 --> 16:13.890
Come on, think!

305
16:14.750 --> 16:15.340
I've got it!

306
16:15.510 --> 16:16.420
Since it's a demon,

307
16:16.480 --> 16:17.180
rip out its demonic core,

308
16:17.270 --> 16:18.130
and it'll die for sure.

309
16:18.270 --> 16:18.850
Its demonic core?

310
16:21.910 --> 16:22.530
Qi Fengyin!

311
16:23.200 --> 16:24.340
Its demonic core is in its forehead!

312
16:50.200 --> 16:51.130
What do we do, Yamao?

313
16:51.270 --> 16:52.850
His Lordship can't get close to it!

314
16:56.910 --> 16:57.700
Yamao!

315
18:00.640 --> 18:01.290
My Lord!

316
18:06.640 --> 18:07.220
Qi Fengyin!

317
18:17.160 --> 18:17.980
Don't touch my blood.

318
18:18.160 --> 18:18.980
Don't worry about me.

319
18:19.440 --> 18:20.530
Worry about yourself.

320
18:27.750 --> 18:28.660
You can have it back.

321
18:31.240 --> 18:31.860
What are you doing?

322
18:33.200 --> 18:33.730
Qi Fengyin?

323
18:35.720 --> 18:36.330
Qi Fengyin!

324
18:37.790 --> 18:38.570
Qi Fengyin!

325
19:13.830 --> 19:14.490
Yamao.

326
19:15.720 --> 19:16.900
How is His Lordship?

327
19:18.270 --> 19:19.140
He's badly hurt.

328
19:20.750 --> 19:21.770
We gathered some medicine,

329
19:21.830 --> 19:23.290
but I don't know if it'll help Mr. Qi.

330
19:23.590 --> 19:24.770
He saved our lives.

331
19:24.960 --> 19:26.140
We can't let anything happen to him.

332
19:26.510 --> 19:26.980
Yuanbao,

333
19:27.350 --> 19:28.980
you said you wanted to free the demon souls

334
19:28.980 --> 19:30.400
sealed away by the black dragon.

335
19:31.240 --> 19:32.620
We're rushing to build an altar.

336
19:32.830 --> 19:34.010
Before tonight's ritual,

337
19:34.010 --> 19:34.660
we must break the seal

338
19:34.730 --> 19:35.660
and release the soul flames.

339
19:35.920 --> 19:36.940
Since time is short,

340
19:37.310 --> 19:38.330
don't wait around here.

341
19:38.510 --> 19:39.570
Go build the altar.

342
19:40.510 --> 19:41.380
But...

343
19:41.960 --> 19:42.730
There's nothing

344
19:42.750 --> 19:43.770
you can do to help here.

345
19:43.920 --> 19:45.380
Once my spiritual power returns tonight,

346
19:45.590 --> 19:46.810
I'll heal him.

347
19:47.350 --> 19:48.330
Thank you, Yamao.

348
19:49.830 --> 19:50.770
Then I'll help

349
19:50.790 --> 19:51.700
prepare the altar too.

350
19:52.000 --> 19:52.940
Call if you need me.

351
19:53.030 --> 19:54.050
I'll come right back.

352
19:55.440 --> 19:55.770
Let's go.

353
20:13.200 --> 20:14.250
What am I doing?

354
20:19.240 --> 20:20.980
He's unconscious

355
20:21.590 --> 20:22.380
and barely alive.

356
20:23.000 --> 20:24.140
If I miss this chance,

357
20:24.590 --> 20:26.050
I may never get another chance to kill him.

358
20:26.240 --> 20:28.440
The world's malice is endless,

359
20:28.550 --> 20:30.470
and he keeps absorbing it to grow stronger.

360
20:30.480 --> 20:31.700
I'm afraid it won't be long

361
20:31.880 --> 20:32.570
before Qi Fengyin

362
20:32.720 --> 20:34.010
becomes the Devil Incarnate.

363
20:35.590 --> 20:36.460
If I kill him,

364
20:37.070 --> 20:38.860
the immortal sects won't need to sacrifice me

365
20:39.030 --> 20:40.380
to awaken the Saintess of the Tides.

366
20:41.270 --> 20:42.330
Master will be saved,

367
20:43.240 --> 20:44.420
and the mystical flower won't keep me

368
20:44.440 --> 20:45.730
bound to Qi Fengyin anymore.

369
20:46.830 --> 20:48.900
For my sake and the world's,

370
20:49.750 --> 20:50.860
he must die.

371
21:06.160 --> 21:06.730
Qi Fengyin!

372
21:13.240 --> 21:14.660
You said you and I were different.

373
21:15.790 --> 21:17.250
But I don't think we are.

374
21:19.480 --> 21:20.570
To know someone's true nature,

375
21:21.480 --> 21:22.860
one should look at what they do,

376
21:24.160 --> 21:25.380
not what they say.

377
21:28.920 --> 21:29.980
Master once said,

378
21:31.480 --> 21:34.090
"Those who do wrong without ill intent deserve no punishment."

379
21:35.680 --> 21:36.530
Qi Fengyin,

380
21:37.790 --> 21:39.490
I believe you're good at heart.

381
21:42.880 --> 21:45.570
- Yuanbao. - Yuanbao.

382
21:51.160 --> 21:52.050
With the black dragon dead,

383
21:52.640 --> 21:53.570
this place is finally starting

384
21:53.590 --> 21:54.810
to look like a paradise.

385
21:55.880 --> 21:56.380
Yes.

386
21:56.790 --> 21:58.330
At the Zi hour, when all things are renewed,

387
21:58.750 --> 21:59.980
we'll use the power of this ritual

388
22:00.070 --> 22:01.090
to break the black dragon's seal

389
22:01.440 --> 22:02.530
and finally free

390
22:02.550 --> 22:03.570
all the demon soul flames

391
22:03.590 --> 22:04.490
it has imprisoned.

392
22:05.590 --> 22:06.770
You've helped them.

393
22:07.200 --> 22:08.530
You can write down a wish

394
22:08.550 --> 22:09.460
and let the soul flames carry it away.

395
22:09.480 --> 22:10.330
It can bring you good fortune.

396
22:10.830 --> 22:11.330
Really?

397
22:15.240 --> 22:16.570
When the time comes,

398
22:17.000 --> 22:18.090
the flames will fill the sky.

399
22:18.680 --> 22:19.860
It'll be beautiful.

400
22:36.880 --> 22:37.700
What's that sound?

401
22:43.590 --> 22:44.900
Here, tie this up.

402
23:29.720 --> 23:30.290
Qi Fengyin!

403
23:31.270 --> 23:31.970
I just managed

404
23:31.970 --> 23:33.010
to pull you back from death's door.

405
23:33.960 --> 23:34.770
What are you doing?

406
23:35.580 --> 23:36.520
Where's Youyou?

407
23:36.640 --> 23:37.140
Youyou?

408
23:37.920 --> 23:39.460
She went to the altar with Yuanbao.

409
23:40.000 --> 23:40.900
Worry about yourself

410
23:40.920 --> 23:41.490
first.

411
23:42.680 --> 23:44.220
Why is your dark energy out of control again?

412
23:44.400 --> 23:45.250
The black markings are back too.

413
23:45.790 --> 23:46.700
They haven't appeared in so long.

414
23:46.880 --> 23:48.010
Hurry and suppress them.

415
23:49.590 --> 23:50.750
Something's wrong with the altar.

416
23:51.640 --> 23:52.980
They've trapped Youyou there

417
23:54.200 --> 23:55.290
to burn her as a sacrifice.

418
23:57.640 --> 23:58.460
Burn her as a sacrifice?

419
23:59.480 --> 24:00.380
What is he talking about?

420
24:08.510 --> 24:09.460
That spot's still empty.

421
24:10.200 --> 24:10.810
- All right. - All right.

422
24:11.510 --> 24:12.490
Keep it up, everyone!

423
24:16.510 --> 24:17.620
Mr. Qi, you're awake?

424
24:20.640 --> 24:22.570
Thank you for saving us

425
24:22.790 --> 24:24.010
and slaying the black dragon!

426
24:27.270 --> 24:28.260
Move.

427
24:30.270 --> 24:30.660
Well...

428
24:33.550 --> 24:34.250
Mr. Qi,

429
24:34.290 --> 24:35.380
are you going to the altar?

430
24:36.110 --> 24:37.860
One of my people is being held inside.

431
24:40.510 --> 24:41.530
You mean Youyou?

432
24:41.830 --> 24:42.920
She was feeling tired

433
24:42.920 --> 24:43.900
and went back to rest.

434
24:44.160 --> 24:44.530
Mr. Qi,

435
24:44.550 --> 24:45.490
you must be mistaken.

436
24:45.640 --> 24:46.940
How could she be inside the altar?

437
24:47.350 --> 24:47.940
Qi Fengyin,

438
24:48.240 --> 24:49.770
you don't seem yourself.

439
24:49.830 --> 24:50.980
Let's go back, all right?

440
24:58.000 --> 24:59.500
She's inside the altar.

441
25:00.350 --> 25:00.940
Mr. Qi,

442
25:01.510 --> 25:02.290
countless demon souls

443
25:02.290 --> 25:03.460
depend on this altar to pass on.

444
25:03.920 --> 25:04.770
If it's destroyed,

445
25:05.160 --> 25:06.570
they'll vanish for good.

446
25:07.030 --> 25:08.050
Even though you saved us

447
25:08.070 --> 25:08.860
by killing the black dragon,

448
25:09.160 --> 25:10.620
I won't let you destroy the altar.

449
25:11.110 --> 25:11.730
Qi Fengyin,

450
25:11.880 --> 25:12.770
let's look for Youyou first

451
25:12.790 --> 25:13.810
to make sure.

452
25:15.110 --> 25:16.660
I'll say this one last time.

453
25:17.640 --> 25:18.180
Move.

454
25:18.830 --> 25:19.620
I won't move.

455
25:21.240 --> 25:22.460
If you want to destroy the altar,

456
25:23.550 --> 25:24.420
you'll have to step

457
25:24.440 --> 25:25.050
over my dead body.

458
25:29.310 --> 25:32.660
- Yuanbao! - Yuanbao!

459
25:33.920 --> 25:35.050
Put your demonic core away first.

460
25:35.270 --> 25:35.620
You...

461
25:54.110 --> 25:55.290
Have you lost your mind?

462
25:55.590 --> 25:57.290
I know what I'm doing.

463
26:16.590 --> 26:18.050
You slaughtered someone innocent

464
26:20.030 --> 26:21.660
over a baseless hunch?

465
26:23.510 --> 26:24.380
I almost forgot.

466
26:25.880 --> 26:27.090
You're a devil, after all.

467
26:37.880 --> 26:38.730
He told me plainly

468
26:39.160 --> 26:40.090
not to expect anything from him.

469
26:40.270 --> 26:41.700
I was so full of myself.

470
26:42.590 --> 26:43.660
I had neither techniques to rely on

471
26:44.240 --> 26:45.770
nor Master's extraordinary talent,

472
26:46.160 --> 26:46.980
yet I thought

473
26:47.160 --> 26:49.330
I could tame a devil like him.

474
26:49.680 --> 26:51.220
I thought a few words from me

475
26:51.480 --> 26:52.860
could set him on the right path.

476
26:55.070 --> 26:57.940
I should've killed him

477
26:58.400 --> 26:59.700
when he lay wounded and dying.

478
27:01.590 --> 27:02.620
I knew this would happen.

479
27:04.270 --> 27:05.860
I never should've let him live this long.

480
27:09.790 --> 27:11.250
I have Master's soul crystal now,

481
27:12.160 --> 27:14.460
and he's too badly hurt to keep an eye on me.

482
27:15.160 --> 27:15.730
Now

483
27:17.270 --> 27:18.420
is my only chance to leave.

484
27:57.680 --> 27:58.940
Where am I?

485
28:21.160 --> 28:22.730
I thought you had no powers,

486
28:22.830 --> 28:24.140
so I nearly let my guard down

487
28:24.790 --> 28:26.250
and almost let you ruin my plan.

488
28:32.680 --> 28:33.620
Yuanbao?

489
28:37.310 --> 28:38.890
But even if you escaped,

490
28:38.890 --> 28:39.980
it wouldn't change a thing.

491
28:40.310 --> 28:42.050
Qi Fengyin is weak from his injuries,

492
28:42.510 --> 28:43.290
and that little herb spirit,

493
28:43.310 --> 28:44.860
the only one who could help him,

494
28:45.200 --> 28:46.810
has abandoned him.

495
28:51.750 --> 28:52.380
As for you,

496
28:53.110 --> 28:53.810
you useless demon,

497
28:53.830 --> 28:55.220
what could you possibly do?

498
28:57.790 --> 28:58.940
You lied to me.

499
29:00.000 --> 29:01.530
You lied to Yamao and His Lordship too.

500
29:02.160 --> 29:03.490
We helped you drive off the black dragon

501
29:03.640 --> 29:04.500
and protect the demons.

502
29:04.920 --> 29:06.330
Is this how you repay our kindness?

503
29:07.030 --> 29:07.900
What demons?

504
29:12.590 --> 29:14.090
Aren't they all in there?

505
29:20.110 --> 29:21.770
You dared to call me a vile demon

506
29:22.550 --> 29:23.940
and a piece of trash.

507
29:24.070 --> 29:25.330
Once I've killed Qi Fengyin,

508
29:25.640 --> 29:26.700
I'll deal with you.

509
29:35.350 --> 29:35.900
You vile demon!

510
29:36.400 --> 29:37.220
With all your power,

511
29:37.240 --> 29:38.290
you choose to attack your own kind?

512
29:44.590 --> 29:45.620
She's the black dragon!

513
29:59.270 --> 30:00.900
Oh, Qi Fengyin,

514
30:01.550 --> 30:02.620
you got yourself hurt like this

515
30:02.640 --> 30:03.770
for those two worthless fools.

516
30:04.550 --> 30:05.330
But who cares

517
30:05.350 --> 30:06.940
whether you live or die?

518
30:32.030 --> 30:33.250
Why the flowers?

519
30:34.750 --> 30:36.940
A sacrifice should be a solemn affair.

520
30:40.110 --> 30:41.010
You wake up,

521
30:41.030 --> 30:42.330
and that's all you want to ask?

522
30:42.550 --> 30:43.860
Aren't you curious who I am

523
30:44.550 --> 30:46.730
or why I'm doing this?

524
30:47.160 --> 30:48.810
You went to all this trouble

525
30:49.830 --> 30:51.290
to bind me with a dragon's claws

526
30:51.960 --> 30:53.180
for the Mystical Core, didn't you?

527
30:55.310 --> 30:56.250
Clever.

528
30:56.790 --> 30:57.530
But

529
30:58.350 --> 31:00.050
I still have you in the palm of my hand.

530
31:01.590 --> 31:03.180
The Mystical Core is hidden in this paradise.

531
31:03.480 --> 31:04.770
Only the Saintess of the Tides

532
31:05.110 --> 31:06.460
can make it appear.

533
31:07.030 --> 31:07.620
So

534
31:08.200 --> 31:09.900
I had to use the energy of bloodshed

535
31:10.240 --> 31:11.770
to counter the Void Arts.

536
31:12.750 --> 31:13.950
Now I'll add

537
31:13.950 --> 31:15.330
your vicious, vengeful soul,

538
31:16.720 --> 31:17.940
the world's greatest evil,

539
31:18.310 --> 31:20.010
to counter the magic of the Saintess of the Tides.

540
31:20.550 --> 31:21.490
Isn't it brilliant?

541
31:26.830 --> 31:27.980
You're about to die,

542
31:28.640 --> 31:30.090
yet you show no fear.

543
31:30.440 --> 31:31.770
The whole world wants me dead.

544
31:33.550 --> 31:35.460
It's been that way for 1,000 years.

545
31:35.920 --> 31:36.620
I'm used to it.

546
31:37.960 --> 31:38.420
Is that so?

547
31:40.030 --> 31:41.380
But 1,000 years ago,

548
31:41.880 --> 31:43.090
things were different for you.

549
31:44.830 --> 31:46.250
She left you all alone.

550
31:47.920 --> 31:48.900
How pitiful.

551
31:49.550 --> 31:50.940
You know about my past?

552
31:55.270 --> 31:56.250
She didn't even let you

553
31:56.270 --> 31:57.010
keep your memories?

554
32:01.590 --> 32:02.420
It seems

555
32:02.830 --> 32:03.620
you're dying to know

556
32:03.680 --> 32:04.730
what happened back then.

557
32:06.310 --> 32:07.460
Then I'll...

558
32:09.000 --> 32:10.570
tell you nothing.

559
32:11.310 --> 32:12.530
If you die without answers,

560
32:12.790 --> 32:14.050
you'll be even more resentful, won't you?

561
32:23.110 --> 32:24.290
Someone's broken in.

562
32:25.000 --> 32:26.140
Of all times, why now?

563
32:50.270 --> 32:51.530
You still had enough strength to escape?

564
32:51.830 --> 32:53.180
You rotten flood dragon,

565
32:53.590 --> 32:54.530
die!

566
33:04.830 --> 33:05.730
I'm doomed!

567
33:06.270 --> 33:07.770
Yamao's so unreliable.

568
33:07.880 --> 33:09.700
I'm going to die trapped in here!

569
33:12.070 --> 33:12.770
Bad-mouthing me again?

570
33:13.000 --> 33:13.660
I shouldn't have come.

571
33:14.320 --> 33:15.140
Yamao?

572
33:17.640 --> 33:18.730
Yamao!

573
33:19.440 --> 33:20.220
I knew

574
33:20.240 --> 33:22.290
you wouldn't really abandon us!

575
33:25.160 --> 33:25.730
Do I look

576
33:25.750 --> 33:27.010
like a coward who runs from a fight?

577
33:27.030 --> 33:27.330
No.

578
33:27.510 --> 33:28.090
Besides,

579
33:28.550 --> 33:29.180
I was the one

580
33:29.200 --> 33:30.140
who chose to save Qi Fengyin.

581
33:30.440 --> 33:31.330
I should find out for myself

582
33:31.510 --> 33:32.900
whether he was right or wrong.

583
33:34.440 --> 33:35.700
I pretended to leave Peach Blossom Paradise,

584
33:36.270 --> 33:37.290
but I doubled back

585
33:37.290 --> 33:38.330
to find out where you were.

586
33:39.680 --> 33:40.380
But then I saw

587
33:41.030 --> 33:42.180
Yuanbao, who was supposed to be dead,

588
33:42.790 --> 33:43.620
walk brazenly

589
33:43.640 --> 33:44.660
into Qi Fengyin's room.

590
33:46.370 --> 33:47.180
Yamao,

591
33:47.510 --> 33:49.050
you have to get His Lordship out.

592
34:13.480 --> 34:14.530
I thought you'd left.

593
34:15.360 --> 34:16.340
How could I just abandon you?

594
34:17.030 --> 34:17.980
You wretched devil.

595
34:18.230 --> 34:19.170
You kept saying

596
34:19.280 --> 34:20.010
if anything happened to you,

597
34:20.030 --> 34:21.380
you'd crush my master's soul crystal.

598
34:21.670 --> 34:22.690
But when it mattered,

599
34:23.070 --> 34:24.420
you gave it back to me.

600
34:25.150 --> 34:25.780
I refuse to believe

601
34:25.800 --> 34:26.740
that you'd suddenly lose your mind.

602
34:27.230 --> 34:28.300
What if you're wrong to trust...?

603
34:28.360 --> 34:29.340
Enough with the what-ifs!

604
34:29.880 --> 34:30.690
I've gone to so much trouble

605
34:30.710 --> 34:31.650
to save you time and again.

606
34:31.990 --> 34:33.050
Your life belongs to me.

607
34:33.160 --> 34:34.690
I decide whether you live or die!

608
34:50.920 --> 34:51.780
I can't put this fire out.

609
34:52.590 --> 34:53.770
If you don't leave now,

610
34:54.440 --> 34:55.530
you'll be one crispy herb.

611
34:55.550 --> 34:56.050
Shut up!

612
34:56.320 --> 34:57.740
If you can't help, keep quiet.

613
35:01.320 --> 35:02.260
No need to struggle like this.

614
35:02.710 --> 35:03.340
Stand back.

615
35:27.190 --> 35:28.050
It's the Mystical Core.

616
36:04.190 --> 36:04.820
You didn't leave?

617
36:12.400 --> 36:13.460
You worked together to trick me

618
36:13.480 --> 36:14.610
into swallowing a fake Mystical Core?

619
36:15.000 --> 36:16.170
You could hide your identity,

620
36:16.840 --> 36:18.130
but not your malice.

621
36:18.440 --> 36:19.300
The black markings are back too.

622
36:19.880 --> 36:20.780
They haven't appeared in so long.

623
36:20.960 --> 36:22.130
Hurry and suppress them.

624
36:28.190 --> 36:29.210
Mr. Qi, you're awake?

625
36:29.710 --> 36:31.260
Blame your own arrogance and recklessness.

626
36:31.840 --> 36:32.940
You thought you could fool everyone.

627
36:40.480 --> 36:41.300
Qi Fengyin,

628
36:42.710 --> 36:44.780
I know everything about your past,

629
36:45.800 --> 36:47.110
and I know you'll suffer

630
36:47.110 --> 36:48.530
an even worse fate than mine.

631
36:49.110 --> 36:50.740
You want your malice back, huh?

632
36:52.070 --> 36:53.090
Then take it!

633
36:57.110 --> 36:57.900
What have you done?

634
36:58.030 --> 36:58.780
This venomous fang

635
36:58.800 --> 37:00.260
holds 1,000 years of my memories.

636
37:01.320 --> 37:02.460
Once the venom seeps in,

637
37:03.190 --> 37:04.420
you'll see

638
37:04.440 --> 37:05.570
it's all a lie.

639
37:06.030 --> 37:07.420
You've been wrong about everything!

640
37:22.710 --> 37:23.690
It's the Mystical Core.

641
37:25.350 --> 37:29.820
I can finally become a true dragon.

642
37:46.110 --> 37:46.980
Wicked woman.

643
37:47.230 --> 37:48.820
She had to pull one last trick before dying.

644
37:49.360 --> 37:51.210
Can you get that fang out?

645
37:51.550 --> 37:52.010
Don't worry.

646
37:52.320 --> 37:53.090
It can't hurt me.

647
38:12.320 --> 38:13.570
These are the dead islanders' souls.

648
38:14.070 --> 38:14.980
So the black dragon's death

649
38:15.510 --> 38:16.740
is all it takes to free them.

650
38:17.880 --> 38:18.340
Yamao,

651
38:18.710 --> 38:19.740
conjure up some paper and a brush!

652
38:24.320 --> 38:24.650
Here.

653
38:25.960 --> 38:26.300
My Lord.

654
38:27.510 --> 38:28.860
We've helped these demon souls.

655
38:28.960 --> 38:29.570
As they pass on,

656
38:29.590 --> 38:30.420
we can write down our wishes

657
38:30.440 --> 38:31.050
and let these souls

658
38:31.070 --> 38:31.610
carry them away.

659
38:31.710 --> 38:32.570
It can bring us good fortune.

660
38:57.590 --> 38:58.870
I forgot you only know

661
38:58.870 --> 38:59.940
how to write your own name.

662
39:00.190 --> 39:00.860
I'll teach you.

663
39:21.960 --> 39:22.490
What does it mean?

664
39:23.550 --> 39:26.490
It means blooming and bearing fruit.

665
39:26.630 --> 39:27.050
Isn't that

666
39:27.110 --> 39:28.650
exactly what you want?

667
39:31.510 --> 39:31.980
All done?

668
39:39.660 --> 39:42.700
[Kill all immortal jerks]

669
39:42.700 --> 39:46.100
[May Master be safe]

670
39:49.460 --> 39:51.100
[May Master be safe]

671
39:53.020 --> 39:58.860
[Be good]

672
40:02.100 --> 40:04.460
[Be good]

673
40:04.460 --> 40:05.980
[May Master be safe]

674
40:33.920 --> 40:34.300
Don't you

675
40:34.320 --> 40:35.460
owe me quite a few explanations?

676
40:41.440 --> 40:42.460
Why did you bring me here?

677
40:49.920 --> 40:52.340
You gave me back the soul crystal

678
40:52.800 --> 40:53.460
and even gave me time

679
40:53.480 --> 40:54.490
to leave on my own.

680
40:54.920 --> 40:55.780
Weren't you afraid

681
40:56.190 --> 40:57.530
I'd disappear with the mystical flower?

682
41:24.670 --> 41:25.570
I'm not afraid of losing you.

683
41:28.760 --> 41:29.380
Why?

684
41:30.360 --> 41:31.340
Wherever you go,

685
41:32.440 --> 41:33.610
I can always find you.

686
41:50.480 --> 41:52.530
You won't escape this time.

687
41:52.710 --> 41:53.530
The Mystical Core?

688
41:55.190 --> 41:56.420
Good thing you were there.

689
42:05.110 --> 42:06.090
Master!

690
42:06.920 --> 42:08.090
How did you turn into a woman?

691
42:28.940 --> 42:32.980
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

692
42:33.220 --> 42:36.660
♪So many longings♪

693
42:37.340 --> 42:39.420
♪Linger in the web of fate♪

694
42:39.620 --> 42:44.620
♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪

695
42:45.540 --> 42:49.580
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

696
42:49.820 --> 42:53.260
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

697
42:53.940 --> 42:56.020
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

698
42:56.220 --> 43:03.620
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

699
43:05.020 --> 43:08.700
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

700
43:08.940 --> 43:12.620
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

701
43:13.260 --> 43:16.820
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

702
43:17.140 --> 43:21.300
♪Still waits to come true♪

703
43:21.540 --> 43:25.220
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

704
43:25.780 --> 43:29.420
♪I'll stay by your side♪

705
43:29.900 --> 43:33.500
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

706
43:33.740 --> 43:41.060
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪

